AltoNftRewardsAdapter::setPaymentTokenShare
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when payment token share is greater than 0.1 ether
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when payment token share is valid
        ├── when setting normal share value
        │   ├── it should update payment token share
        │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event
        ├── when setting zero share
        │   ├── it should update payment token share
        │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event
        ├── when setting maximum share
        │   ├── it should update payment token share
        │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event
        └── when updating share multiple times
            ├── it should update payment token share for each call
            └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareSet event for each call
